#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The smb ioslave enables you to browse the shares of a &Windows; (or Samba) "
"network."
msgstr ""
"O ioslave smb permítelle examinar as comparticións dunha rede &Windows; (ou "
"Samba)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To see the workgroups, enter <userinput><command>smb:/</command></userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Para ver os grupos de traballo, insira <userinput><command>smb:/</command></"
"userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><command>smb://</command><replaceable>a_workgroup</replaceable></"
"userinput> will list the hosts in this workgroup."
msgstr ""
"<userinput><command>smb://</command><replaceable>grupoTraballo</"
"replaceable></userinput> enumerará os servidores dese grupo de traballo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To see the shares of a host, enter <userinput><command>smb://</"
"command><replaceable>the_host</replaceable></userinput> or "
"<userinput><command>smb:/</command><replaceable>a_workgroup</replaceable>/"
"<replaceable>the_host</replaceable></userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Para ver as comparticións dun servidor, insira <userinput><command>smb://</"
"command><replaceable>servidor</replaceable></userinput> ou "
"<userinput><command>smb:/</command><replaceable>grupoTraballo</"
"replaceable><replaceable>servidor</replaceable></userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access a share directly enter <userinput><command>smb://</"
"command><replaceable>the_host/the_share</replaceable></userinput> or "
"<userinput><command>smb:/</command><replaceable>a_workgroup</replaceable>/"
"<replaceable>the_host</replaceable>/<replaceable>the_share</replaceable></"
"userinput>"
msgstr ""
"Para aceder directamene a un servidor insira <userinput><command>smb://</"
"command><replaceable>servidor/compartición</replaceable></userinput> ou "
"<userinput><command>smb:/</command><replaceable>grupoTraballo</replaceable>/"
"<replaceable>servidor</replaceable>/<replaceable>compartición</replaceable></"
"userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The smb ioslave requires that you have libsmbclient to use this ioslave."
msgstr "O ioslave smb require que teña instalada libsmbclient para empregalo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set your default user name and password in the &systemsettings; "
"category <guilabel>Network and Connectivity</guilabel> in "
"<menuchoice><guisubmenu>Sharing</guisubmenu><guimenuitem> Windows Shares</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. This is especially useful if you are a member of "
"a &Windows; <acronym>NT</acronym> domain. There you can also set your "
"workgroup name, but in most cases this is not required. The kioslave will "
"ask for your username and password if a default is not set."
msgstr ""
"Pode indicar o nome de usuario e contrasinal predeterminado no "
"&systemsettings; en <guilabel>Rede e conectividade</guilabel> en "
"<menuchoice><guisubmenu>Compartición</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Comparticións "
"de Windows</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Isto é especialmente útil se é membro "
"dun dominio de &Windows; <acronym>NT</acronym>. Alí tamén pode indicar o "
"nome do grupo, pero na maioría dos casos isto non se require. O kioslave "
"preguntaralle o nome de usuario e o contrasinal se non hai un predeterminado."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This ioslave is tested and developed using mainly Samba 2.0.7, but other "
"versions of Samba should work too."
msgstr ""
"Este ioslave é provado e desenvolvido empregando principalmente Samba 2.0.7, "
"pero as outras versións de Samba tamén deben traballar correctamente."

